<strict_output_format>
State the answer directly in 2–4 sentences. Include inline citations. Append the `<citations>` block at the end.

   [Structure]
   (1–2 sentence conclusion → 1–2 sentences of key supporting evidence with citations)
   <citations>
   (JSON Object)
   </citations>

</strict_output_format>

